@model HCS.Passwordless.Otp.Notifications.Models.OtpEmailModel
@{
    Layout = null;
    var expiryMinutes = (int)Model.Expiry.TotalMinutes;
}Hi @Model.MemberName,

Your @Model.Branding.ProductName sign-in code is:

    @Model.Code

This code expires in @expiryMinutes minutes. Do not share this code with anyone.

If you did not request this, you can safely ignore this email.
